From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Telaak <joseph@telaak.dev>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:32:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: adv7511: Accept S32_LE I2S samples

Commit 7c3127e4814c ("drm: bridge: adv7511: remove s32 format from i2s
capabilities") dropped S32_LE, which hw_params rejected, as the ADV7511
takes at most 24 bits per I2S sample.

McBSP puts no padding between words and offers only S16_LE and S32_LE,
so with 32-bit slots S32_LE is its only format. As hdmi-codec's own
I2S_FORMATS comment says, a 32-bit format gives 24-bit precision to such
CPU DAIs. Advertise S32_LE again and program it like S24_LE: in I2S and
left-justified modes the ADV7511 takes the top 24 bits of the slot, and
hdmi-codec reports 24 significant bits. Right-justified it would take
the low 24 bits, so a 32-bit sample is still refused there.

Tested on an OMAP3630 board whose McBSP sends 2 x 32-bit I2S slots to
an ADV7513: a left-only and a right-only S32_LE tone at 44.1 kHz both
play at full level.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_audio.c | 4 +++-
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_drv.c   | 1 +
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_audio.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_audio.c
index 87e7e820810a..8e38b936ef6c 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_audio.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_audio.c
@@ -105,7 +105,9 @@ int adv7511_hdmi_audio_prepare(struct drm_bridge *bridge,
 		len = ADV7511_I2S_SAMPLE_LEN_20;
 		break;
 	case 32:
-		if (fmt->bit_fmt != SNDRV_PCM_FORMAT_IEC958_SUBFRAME_LE)
+		/* Right-justified takes the low 24 bits of a 32-bit slot */
+		if (fmt->fmt == HDMI_RIGHT_J &&
+		    fmt->bit_fmt != SNDRV_PCM_FORMAT_IEC958_SUBFRAME_LE)
 			return -EINVAL;
 		fallthrough;
 	case 24:
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_drv.c
index d3964adbb106..0cff81a6c086 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/adv7511/adv7511_drv.c
@@ -1351,6 +1351,7 @@ static int adv7511_probe(struct i2c_client *i2c)
 						  SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S20_3LE |
 						  SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_3LE |
 						  SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_LE |
+						  SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S32_LE |
 						  SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_IEC958_SUBFRAME_LE),
 	adv7511->bridge.hdmi_audio_spdif_playback = 1;
 	adv7511->bridge.hdmi_audio_dai_port = 2;
